<title>SOUTH AFRICA: MATHOMO SAYS TALKS CONTINUING.</title>
<headline>MATHOMO SAYS TALKS CONTINUING.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mathomo Group Ltd said on Friday that talks, first announced on August 21, were continuing.</p>
<p>The outcome of the negotiations could have an in impact on its share price and the company urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>It gave no further details in a brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
